-- collapse whose mixture condition is a call to another definition (the
-- helper-extract rewrite of collapseMixture, same law: mu = 3,
-- sigma^2 = 4.75). The generate function reads the call's probability, so it
-- must see the callee's result in the layout the probability functions do
-- (branch-count field stripped), and under topK pass a cutoff it has no
-- parameter for.
main = collapse (if cond then Normal * 2.0 else Normal + 4.0)
cond = Uniform < 0.25
